{"name":"-56-1-A","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Truth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"—We can't give up yet. The dawn has come."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"—No, there's nothing ahead of us..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"—Yes, there is, we just need to wait for the sun to rise!"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"—But we can't hold on any longer. Who knows if we'll be able to hold out until then..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bell","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"—The old world has come to an end."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"—But what of the new world? The new world..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"—The new world begins in 2051..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-Corridor","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Berlin, in the temporary Griffin base."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_EV9_Story","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tap, tap— Tap, tap—"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander's footsteps echo loudly through the empty corridor."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beep-beep-beep!! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's Helian."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"t